.523">When </span><span begin="00:40.523" end="00:41.083">I'm </span><span begin="00:41.083" end="00:41.499">with </span><span begin="00:41.499" end="00:42.323">you </span><span begin="00:42.915" end="00:43.275">and </span><span begin="00:43.275" end="00:43.643">when </span><span begin="00:43.643" end="00:44.483">you're </span><span begin="00:44.483" end="00:47.331">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.693" end="00:55.045"><span begin="00:50.693" end="00:51.101">My </span><span begin="00:51.101" end="00:52.485">thoughts </span><span begin="00:52.485" end="00:52.861">are </span><span begin="00:52.861" end="00:53.245">so </span><span begin="00:53.245" end="00:55.045">incomplete</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.402" end="01:00.146"><span begin="00:55.402" end="00:55.826">I </span><span begin="00:55.826" end="00:56.266">can't </span><span begin="00:56.266" end="00:56.674">put </span><span begin="00:56.674" end="00:57.186">my </span><span begin="00:57.186" end="00:58.250">finger </span><span begin="00:58.250" end="00:58.610">on </span><span begin="00:58.610" end="00:59.010">this </span><span begin="00:59.010" end="01:00.146">feeling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.258" end="01:02.922"><span begin="01:00.258" end="01:00.626">I </span><span begin="01:00.626" end="01:00.970">wanna </span><span begin="01:00.970" end="01:01.242">call </span><span begin="01:01.242" end="01:01.562">it </span><span begin="01:01.562" end="01:02.922">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.950" end="01:13.022"><span begin="01:02.950" end="01:03.294">But </span><span begin="01:03.294" end="01:03.686">I'm </span><span begin="01:03.686" end="01:04.638">not </span><span begin="01:05.238" end="01:05.806">convinced </span><span begin="01:05.806" end="01:06.342">that </span><span begin="01:06.342" end="01:06.774">is </span><span begin="01:06.774" end="01:07.846">all </span><span begin="01:08.966" end="01:09.870">it </span><span begin="01:09.870" end="01:13.022">is</span></